<title>USA: US West Communications looks for Japha successor.</title>
<headline>US West Communications looks for Japha successor.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. West Communications said Tuesday its Chief Financial Officer Barbara Japha has moved to the legal department of U.S. West Inc, to head the new Corporate Transactions Section.</p>
<p>The section will handle all domestic corporate transactions as well as tax and real estate legal matters.</p>
<p>The company said a search is under way for Japha's permanent successor as CFO.</p>
